                "description": "The Providence Knob with Rectangular Rose is the perfect accoutrement to your transitional home. It is not too old world that it dates your decor, but rather breathes a breath of fresh air into traditional spaces. This Transitional Providence Knobset with Rectangular Rose is available in the most commonly needed functions; choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a wide selection of popular finish colors.",
